5. Detailed Service Description

Legal Consultation

Professional legal consultation to understand the facts, identify legal rights and liabilities, evaluate available remedies and determine an appropriate legal strategy.

Litigation & Court Representation

Representation before appropriate courts and tribunals, including preparation of pleadings, applications, arguments and other necessary proceedings.

Property Legal Services

Assistance relating to ownership, title, possession, partition, sale, purchase, inheritance, documentation and property disputes.

Criminal Defence

Legal assistance in criminal complaints, bail proceedings, criminal trials, appeals, revisions and other criminal proceedings.

Family Law

Professional assistance in matrimonial, divorce, maintenance, domestic violence, custody, guardianship and family-property disputes.

Banking & DRT Matters

Representation in disputes involving banks, financial institutions, recovery proceedings, SARFAESI proceedings, DRT matters and auction/possession disputes.

Legal Notices

Drafting and issuing legally appropriate notices relating to recovery, property, contractual, matrimonial, consumer and other disputes.

Legal Documentation

Preparation, review and legal analysis of agreements, affidavits, deeds, contracts and other legal documents.

