About Section

Experienced Legal Counsel. Practical Legal Solutions.

Vinayakumar P, Advocate & Legal Consultant, provides legal consultation, litigation representation and documentation services across various areas of law.

With a client-focused approach, the practice aims to understand each matter comprehensively, identify the appropriate legal remedies and provide practical legal strategies suited to the client’s circumstances.

⸻

Practice Areas

Civil Litigation
Legal representation in civil disputes, suits, appeals and execution proceedings.

Property Law
Assistance with property disputes, title issues, partition, possession and documentation.

Criminal Law
Representation in criminal complaints, bail, trials, appeals, revisions and related proceedings.

Family Law
Legal assistance in matrimonial, divorce, maintenance, custody and family disputes.

Banking & DRT
Representation in banking recovery, DRT and SARFAESI-related matters.

Consumer Law
Assistance in consumer disputes, deficiency of service and compensation claims.

Cheque Bounce Matters
Legal assistance relating to Section 138 Negotiable Instruments Act proceedings.

Legal Documentation
Drafting and review of agreements, notices, affidavits and legal documents.

